WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.633
Upload an image accepts JPEG, PNG, WebP, or AVIF files up to ten megabytes.

00:00:06.683 --> 00:00:10.178
Write useful alt text describing the image,

00:00:10.228 --> 00:00:13.394
or mark it decorative when appropriate.

00:00:13.444 --> 00:00:16.609
The website creates the sizes it needs.

00:00:16.659 --> 00:00:21.473
We are showing the upload form without adding another copy.
